Z||000000||Jay||08-13-2001||04:49 PM||||Well I went to the Cayuga this week-end and I beat last years time by 2/10ths.  13.6 @ 101mph.  60' was 2 seconds.  1/8th 8.8 @82mph.  Reaction time .663  I actually beat every car I raced against.  One was a turbo Integra that runs 12's but he missed a gear and I never looked back.  It was fun <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">.  Also watched a new Canadian record for imports...Mike P with a white civic turbo intercooler ran a 10.04!!!!Unbelievable!!<P>What are you other Northstars and turbos running?<P>------------------<BR>Jay<BR>1986 Northstar GT<BR>www.members.home.net/jaygrande<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/cayuga3_3.jpg"> ||||reg||1
