Z||000012||Formula88||08-13-2001||07:30 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Slammed Fiero:<BR><B>I don't think that his mid 13's are the best. I remember riding in Chris moores car , which turned nearly identical times at the strip. The car seemed like a slug (sorry chris) off the line , then it hit about 25-30mph and slammed you back in the seat. The powerband is so progressive on those motors with No flat spots, reminded me a lot of a 911 , power everywhere above 2500rpm.<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Sounds like a 5-speed and a 3500 rpm launch could turn a 13.6sec "slug" into a 12 second terror!?!||||reg||6
